        <abstract>
            <para>
Terrestrial plant vouchers opportunistically collected during NEON plant diversity surveys. Primarily meant to be an archive for taxonomic and genetic vouchering.
Sampling

Collected once a year at a site
Collections guided by site-specific rank-abundance lists derived from plant presence and percent cover data
Vouchers also collected for specimens selected for genetic leaf tissue sampling
Can also include vouchers taken for unknown or hard to identify species

Methods

Can be pressed in the field
Ideally includes necessary diagnostic parts

Preservation

Archived as pressed herbarium vouchers at room temperature


</para>
        </abstract>
